temFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI完成150亿美元私募融资，估值达1.25万亿美元备战2027年IPO</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Edge0 正式开源 145B 端侧模型，内存占用降低 60% 并支持本地运行</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic启动IPO认购获六倍超额认购，英伟达拟投资100亿美元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌联合三星等品牌发布Gemini智能眼镜，起售价395美元并引入远程锁机隐私条款</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式开启Intelligent Eyewear系列智能眼镜预售，起售价为395美元。该产品由谷歌联合三星、Gentle Monster及Warby Parker共同打造，谷歌负责提供底层Gemini AI能力与核心系统支持，其余合作伙伴负责硬件形态、工业设计与光学镜架。此次发布标志着Gemini助手正式进入端侧可穿戴硬件领域。针对公众关注的隐私问题，谷歌在服务条款中开创性引入“双向隐私”规定，严禁绕过系统机制进行违规拍摄或滥用设备功能。谷歌明确表示，对于违反隐私条款的用户，官方保留远程锁机的权力，旨在通过技术与制度双重手段划定智能穿戴设备的隐私边界。此举不仅强化了具身智能设备的合规性，也为行业在平衡AI功能与个人隐私保护方面提供了新的参考范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布 Gemini 4 Hydrogen 大模型，主打高速编程与智能体任务处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布新一代大模型 Gemini 4 Hydrogen，在运行速度、编程能力及智能体（Agent）任务处理方面实现显著升级。性能指标显示，该模型在默认高推理档位下的运行速度较 Gemini 3.8 Flash 提升 2.5 倍；在 Terminal-Bench 4.1 编程基准测试中，得分从 18.2% 跃升至 57%，且幻觉率显著降低。Gemini 4 Hydrogen 支持 100 万词元的输入与输出能力，API 定价为输入每百万词元 1.50 美元，输出每百万词元 7.50 美元。普通用户可通过 Gemini 应用的自动模型选择功能体验该模型。此外，谷歌同步推出 Orchestrator 功能，支持多模型间的动态任务分配与协同，旨在提升复杂长流程任务的处理效率。此次更新旨在通过更强的编程与终端操作能</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI完成150亿美元私募融资，估值达1.25万亿美元备战2027年IPO</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近期完成新一轮150亿美元私募融资，融资前估值达1.25万亿美元，该轮融资预计于数周内正式收口，旨在为2027年启动的IPO储备资金。财务数据显示，OpenAI今年第三季度营收约100亿美元，环比增长近50%，但同期运营亏损达109亿美元，调整后营业利润率为-109%。高额亏损主要源于模型训练、推理服务及数据中心建设等重资产投入。随着Anthropic计划于11月19日登陆纳斯达克，两家头部AI公司即将进入公开市场竞争阶段。此次融资不仅强化了OpenAI的现金储备，也标志着其正式进入备战IPO的关键周期，投资者将通过后续财报更直观地评估其营收增速与烧钱效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Edge0 正式开源 145B 端侧模型，内存占用降低 60% 并支持本地运行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc8a0302d9c76c58b966aafbbb70590e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">开源项目 Edge0 近日发布并开源了 Edge0-145B 与 Edge0-120B 模型，标志着 1450 亿参数模型首次实现个人电脑本地流畅运行。该模型通过稀疏专家架构（MoE）、端侧协同训练及三层存储智能流水线技术，在保持云端级编程与推理能力的同时，将内存占用降低了 40% 至 60%。在搭载 M 系列芯片的 MacBook 或 RTX 4090/5090 等硬件上，Edge0-145B 峰值内存占用仅 29GB，解码速度超 80 tokens/s，支持 128K 至 256K 上下文。其在 DeepSWE1.1 等基准测试中表现优异，可独立完成复杂本地工作流，如 3D 建模、代码编写及无人机控制。目前，Edge0 已开源包含语音、文本、视觉等四大系列共 200 个模型，完整权重已上线 Hugging</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic启动IPO认购获六倍超额认购，英伟达拟投资100亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic即将进行的IPO引发市场高度关注，目前认购订单已达可供股份数的约6倍，承销银行表示将优先照顾现有股东，新进场投资者面临砍单风险。此次融资规模庞大，Anthropic拟通过IPO募资至多644亿美元，并配套260亿美元私募配售，完全稀释后目标估值约1.4万亿美元。其中，战略合作伙伴英伟达计划在私募环节认购约100亿美元。截至10月31日，Anthropic的营收运行率已达810亿美元，较9月底增长100亿美元。为进一步推动上市进程，CEO达里奥·阿莫代伊将于11月13日与摩根大通CEO戴蒙进行直播。此次融资不仅刷新了AI行业融资纪录，也凸显了英伟达在AI算力生态中对核心模型厂商的深度绑定。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
